+
+The scan has narrowed toward a sharper quantum-representation question: which noise laws make all linear combinations jointly classical? Meanwhile, two combinatorial openings appear recently solved, so I’m probing their boundaries.
+
+The quantum route now uses dependent, slowly varying exponential tilts, potentially preserving marginals and exact finite-dimensional statistics beyond an independence-based no-go. Separately, I’m testing adaptive scales for rapidly shrinking Erdős-similarity sequences.
